WEBVTT

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:11.790
We should go, Boss.

00:02:48.135 --> 00:02:49.694
A fang...

00:03:11.258 --> 00:03:14.091
Who am I sensing...?!

00:03:17.931 --> 00:03:22.311
Welcome back. I'm glad
to see you're safe.

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:24.235
Kuriyagawa-san...

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:30.909
"A Warrior's Heart"

00:03:41.288 --> 00:03:44.417
Madam. I've brought Master Baki.

00:03:45.358 --> 00:03:47.292
Pause the monitor.

00:03:48.161 --> 00:03:49.356
Baki!

00:03:50.397 --> 00:03:51.956
Been a while!

00:03:52.566 --> 00:03:54.091
Welcome back.

00:04:00.373 --> 00:04:02.351
Have you gotten fatter...?

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:05.588
No, but I did get bigger.

00:04:05.612 --> 00:04:08.638
Fighting that ape made you stronger?

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:12.980
Your news comes as fast as ever.

00:04:15.622 --> 00:04:21.270
Baki. While you were out fighting
apes, the world continued on.

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:25.842
The greatest match-up of the
century! Yuri versus Quevas!

00:04:25.866 --> 00:04:28.836
And there's the bell!

00:04:30.604 --> 00:04:34.404
But it wound up a big
disappointment once it started.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:51.134
One! Two! Three! Four! Five!

00:04:51.158 --> 00:04:53.703
A formidable right counter...

00:04:53.727 --> 00:04:56.572
That's how it was described on
the front of every sports section.

00:04:56.596 --> 00:04:59.759
Could you dodge it?

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:04.080
Actually, after winning
the match, Yuri announced

00:05:04.104 --> 00:05:07.917
he would challenge the
heavyweight circuit next.

00:05:07.941 --> 00:05:11.387
Presently, Yuri weighs 81 kilograms.

00:05:11.411 --> 00:05:16.726
He's succeeded in gaining
15 kilograms in 2 months

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:20.448
while maintaining his speed
and increasing his muscle mass.

00:05:23.123 --> 00:05:28.671
Well, Baki? Your rival's put
a lot of distance between you.

00:05:28.695 --> 00:05:30.322
He's slow.

00:05:30.597 --> 00:05:33.075
Yuri is?!

00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:37.814
The Yuri I remember was
five times faster than this.

00:05:37.838 --> 00:05:40.170
This is like he's in slow motion.

00:05:43.376 --> 00:05:45.606
--Kuriyagawa.
--Yes, ma'am!

00:06:05.765 --> 00:06:08.811
Am I dreaming?

00:06:08.835 --> 00:06:12.715
The welterweight Yuri is
overwhelming a heavyweight, Doctor.

00:06:12.739 --> 00:06:17.142
May I make a few changes,
Coach Viadimir?

00:06:19.112 --> 00:06:25.061
Yuri Chakovsky is the world's fastest

00:06:25.085 --> 00:06:30.182
and most skilled heavyweight fighter.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:37.974
If you leave him to our
renowned medical staff,

00:06:37.998 --> 00:06:41.444
he will become the
undisputed world champion.

00:06:41.468 --> 00:06:43.596
That's reassuring, Doctor.

00:06:44.371 --> 00:06:45.167
Next!

00:06:46.339 --> 00:06:52.288
He has the finest staff. Not to
mention heavyweight muscle and power.

00:06:52.312 --> 00:06:53.609
He's perfect...

00:07:07.894 --> 00:07:10.339
100-million yen.

00:07:10.363 --> 00:07:12.475
I'd like you to free-fight once more

00:07:12.499 --> 00:07:16.579
with the boy you sparred
with 3 months ago.

00:07:16.603 --> 00:07:21.250
I despise Japanese like you
who think a glimpse of cash

00:07:21.274 --> 00:07:26.889
can bend a person's will
to do their bidding.

00:07:26.913 --> 00:07:29.158
I have only one desire...

00:07:29.182 --> 00:07:32.361
...to prove that the blood of
the peerless Xigil people

00:07:32.385 --> 00:07:34.830
is the greatest in the world!

00:07:34.854 --> 00:07:39.702
My only goal is to win the
heavyweight boxing title

00:07:39.726 --> 00:07:42.805
and be recognized as the
world's strongest fighter!

00:07:42.829 --> 00:07:45.423
You're all ignorant of the world.

00:07:47.701 --> 00:07:51.080
We don't recognize the
world boxing champ

00:07:51.104 --> 00:07:54.016
as the world's strongest fighter.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:57.601
If you're truly seeking to be
the world's strongest, then--

00:07:59.045 --> 00:08:00.410
Goodbye.

00:08:07.153 --> 00:08:12.134
As I've said, he and Yuri's
fight will come first.

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:16.439
That doesn't mean you won't be
able to fight him. It just-

00:08:16.463 --> 00:08:18.522
Yujiro Hanma...

00:08:21.668 --> 00:08:25.247
Will I really get to meet him?

00:08:25.271 --> 00:08:30.753
If you win the fight, his
father will undoubtedly appear.

00:08:30.777 --> 00:08:34.824
After all, Yujiro-sama places
fighting above all else.

00:08:34.848 --> 00:08:37.613
Even above water, food, and women.

00:08:46.893 --> 00:08:51.207
So your match with him will
take place after he fights Yuri...

00:08:51.231 --> 00:08:54.076
--That doesn't matter.
--Doesn't matter...?!

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:57.747
The fight'll happen
whenever we run into him.

00:08:57.771 --> 00:09:03.938
He can fight whoever he wants;
we do things our own way.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.185
Hey, Yuri.

00:09:17.357 --> 00:09:20.224
These fellows are your opponents today.

00:09:27.267 --> 00:09:31.101
--I'll destroy them all.
--Is Yuri-san here?

00:09:35.708 --> 00:09:36.685
Hello!

00:09:36.709 --> 00:09:42.091
--Did you come to fight me?
--Fight? Heck, no.

00:09:42.115 --> 00:09:47.029
Everyone's trying to make me fight
you, but they don't understand.

00:09:47.053 --> 00:09:50.079
They all think sports and
fighting are the same.

00:09:51.124 --> 00:09:52.768
Sports and fighting?

00:09:52.792 --> 00:09:56.126
You're saying boxing isn't fighting?

00:09:57.564 --> 00:10:02.229
Sorry, but boxing is too
incomplete to be a fighting style.

00:10:04.737 --> 00:10:07.950
We don't recognize the
world boxing champ

00:10:07.974 --> 00:10:10.807
as the world's strongest fighter.

00:10:12.912 --> 00:10:14.990
I've heard enough, kid.

00:10:15.014 --> 00:10:16.892
Stop. He's just a child.

00:10:16.916 --> 00:10:20.147
I just wanna teach him something.

00:10:28.461 --> 00:10:31.158
He sent that 100-kilogram
water bag flying!

00:10:33.333 --> 00:10:36.132
Was that punch incomplete?

00:10:48.381 --> 00:10:53.285
W-What a huge back...!

00:11:18.945 --> 00:11:24.293
You wear gloves.
There are no kicks, no holds.

00:11:24.317 --> 00:11:27.663
No throws, no special techniques.

00:11:27.687 --> 00:11:31.487
That's why a boxer is too
incomplete to be a Grappler!

00:11:45.838 --> 00:11:49.251
The day all of Japan - and Asia
- has been waiting for is here!

00:11:49.275 --> 00:11:52.321
Tonight, the five-title-holding
Yuri Chakovsky

00:11:52.345 --> 00:11:55.747
will finally attempt to
take the heavyweight title!

00:12:02.355 --> 00:12:06.936
You wear gloves.
There are no kicks, no holds.

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:10.606
No throws, no special techniques.

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:15.090
That's why a boxer is too
incomplete to be a Grappler!

00:12:16.035 --> 00:12:19.615
But what you're trying
to do is incredible.

00:12:19.639 --> 00:12:22.351
I'm behind you all the way.

00:12:22.375 --> 00:12:25.888
For these past three months,
that boy has undergone

00:12:25.912 --> 00:12:28.390
even more intense training than 1?

00:12:28.414 --> 00:12:29.992
Hey, Yuri.

00:12:30.016 --> 00:12:34.630
--It's time. Let's go, Champ!
--OK!

00:12:34.654 --> 00:12:37.453
I'tl prove if it's incomplete or not!

00:12:52.338 --> 00:12:54.583
Has it already started?

00:12:54.607 --> 00:12:59.374
--Not yet. Are you anxious?
--A little.

00:13:05.618 --> 00:13:06.847
Vladimir!

00:13:09.489 --> 00:13:11.787
Who are you?!

00:13:25.305 --> 00:13:28.468
This man is strong...!

00:13:33.613 --> 00:13:37.926
Don Stander has finally
appeared in the ring!

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:41.297
Talk about huge! The Japanese
are used to featherweights,

00:13:41.321 --> 00:13:43.517
so he must seem like a giant!

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:48.003
Oh! And there's the
champ's sister, Nina-san!

00:13:48.027 --> 00:13:50.359
She's here to watch, too!

00:13:52.332 --> 00:13:53.458
Brother...

00:13:54.934 --> 00:13:56.459
Yuri-n

00:13:59.505 --> 00:14:01.684
It's all right, Nina!

00:14:01.708 --> 00:14:03.904
There's just a little
more prey to hunt...

00:14:28.501 --> 00:14:31.129
He's stronger than wolves!

00:14:45.151 --> 00:14:46.949
Yuri...!

00:14:50.089 --> 00:14:52.956
Yuri! Run!

00:15:21.621 --> 00:15:22.782
He's-!

00:15:32.198 --> 00:15:33.461
Crap!

00:15:45.445 --> 00:15:46.776
Brother...!

00:15:59.125 --> 00:16:01.370
Explosives?

00:16:01.394 --> 00:16:05.729
The instant he grabbed Yuri's
arm, I heard an explosion...!

00:16:07.967 --> 00:16:12.734
Sorry, but boxing is too
incomplete to be a fighting style.

00:16:13.506 --> 00:16:15.584
So what?!

00:16:15.608 --> 00:16:18.578
Fighting until the very end...

00:16:19.612 --> 00:16:21.740
...is what a Xigil warrior does!

00:16:26.185 --> 00:16:28.313
Yuri...!

00:16:33.292 --> 00:16:36.455
Yuri has yet to appear.

00:16:37.597 --> 00:16:39.875
Shouldn't he be out by how?

00:16:39.899 --> 00:16:42.911
Let's check in with Nakamura-san
in the waiting room.

00:16:42.935 --> 00:16:44.513
Nakamura here.

00:16:44.537 --> 00:16:49.373
Yuri has left, but |
don't see him anywhere...

00:16:50.743 --> 00:16:52.233
That's odd...

00:17:11.264 --> 00:17:14.700
Giving up already?

00:17:25.945 --> 00:17:28.642
Grandpa... I...

00:17:32.118 --> 00:17:37.181
I don't want to lose!
Not to you, not to anyone!

00:17:47.133 --> 00:17:50.546
Yuri. Xigil warriors never lose.

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:55.317
--They don't...?
--That's right. Never.

00:17:55.341 --> 00:17:59.021
Being knocked down is not true defeat.

00:17:59.045 --> 00:18:04.313
True defeat happens
when your heart yields.

00:18:04.817 --> 00:18:07.218
When your heart yields...?

00:18:07.753 --> 00:18:12.334
Understand? As long
as you never give in,

00:18:12.358 --> 00:18:17.694
not even Genghis Khan himself
can take victory from you!

00:18:23.235 --> 00:18:25.203
Yuri! Stay down!

00:18:39.685 --> 00:18:44.646
My heart... will not yield...!

00:18:48.361 --> 00:18:49.871
He's taken a stance...

00:18:49.895 --> 00:18:52.796
Even after taking a direct
hit from the boss...!

00:18:59.038 --> 00:19:00.699
Stop!

00:19:08.547 --> 00:19:10.606
Yuri!

00:19:13.986 --> 00:19:16.331
Broadcast booth! Broadcast booth!

00:19:16.355 --> 00:19:19.434
Broadcast booth here!
What is it, Nakamura-san?!

00:19:19.458 --> 00:19:24.373
Bad news! Yuri has just
been attacked by someone!

00:19:24.397 --> 00:19:27.833
He's unable to fight! They're
carrying him out on a stretcher!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.940
Excellent work.

00:19:41.447 --> 00:19:44.259
--It's Hanayama...
--Hanayama...?

00:19:44.283 --> 00:19:47.829
The strongest brawler in
Japan, Kaoru Hanayama.

00:19:47.853 --> 00:19:51.312
We do things our own way.

00:19:55.828 --> 00:19:59.594
The boy is a monster.

00:19:59.865 --> 00:20:04.928
Almost no gang wants to
get involved with him.

00:20:05.971 --> 00:20:08.550
Sounds like quite the boy.

00:20:08.574 --> 00:20:11.720
I have interesting
information about him.

00:20:11.744 --> 00:20:15.791
--He's able to burst people's arms...
--Burst...?

00:20:15.815 --> 00:20:17.993
Once he's grabbed your arm, it's over.

00:20:18.017 --> 00:20:22.386
Your arm makes an explosion-like
sound and bursts open.

00:20:22.588 --> 00:20:26.001
--So he uses a weapon?
--Quite the opposite.

00:20:26.025 --> 00:20:31.020
His distaste for weapons is seen
as the pinnacle of aesthetics.

00:20:31.797 --> 00:20:33.809
You're certainly quiet.

00:20:33.833 --> 00:20:38.600
Your father would be trembling
with excitement right about now...

00:20:41.774 --> 00:20:43.752
I'm goin' home. I'm sleepy.

00:20:43.776 --> 00:20:44.971
Good night.

00:20:47.713 --> 00:20:50.992
That brings back memories.
He would always hide his excitement

00:20:51.016 --> 00:20:53.610
whenever I bought him a new toy...

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:58.588
--Got it? The sooner, the better!
--Yes, ma'am!

00:21:03.796 --> 00:21:06.197
Kaoru Hanayama...

00:21:06.632 --> 00:21:12.571
--Stop!
--Someone stop him!

00:21:14.039 --> 00:21:15.564
What's goin® on?

00:21:21.113 --> 00:21:23.480
I'll check it out.

00:21:28.053 --> 00:21:30.232
Sorry, Boss!

00:21:30.256 --> 00:21:32.267
You Hanayama-san?

00:21:32.291 --> 00:21:39.141
You're really famous!
Everyone I asked told me about ya!

00:21:39.165 --> 00:21:42.328
I hear you're a good fighter!

00:21:58.784 --> 00:21:59.861
No...!

00:21:59.885 --> 00:22:03.048
Let's get this party started!

00:22:45.965 --> 00:22:51.513
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:51.537 --> 00:22:57.118
<i>hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement</i>

00:22:57.142 --> 00:23:02.791
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:02.815 --> 00:23:07.796
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:13.335
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:13.359 --> 00:23:18.874
<i>gently enveloped in love</i>

00:23:18.898 --> 00:23:24.546
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:30.085
but they will be reborn

00:23:30.109 --> 00:23:35.757
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:35.781 --> 00:23:42.517
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:51.263 --> 00:23:53.027
"Next Episode™

00:23:55.567 --> 00:23:58.628
That night, the men became beasts.

00:23:59.271 --> 00:24:05.904
A devastating eruption rips through
the air after a smaller explosion.

00:24:06.712 --> 00:24:11.826
The sources of the rash man's
power are the scars on his back

00:24:11.850 --> 00:24:13.728
and his male dignity.

00:24:13.752 --> 00:24:16.131
He's a fearless man, in other words.

00:24:16.155 --> 00:24:21.025
"Next Episode: Male Pride™
